---
// Bulk-add dropzones and wind tunnels (sport=indoor_skydiving): OpenStreetMap (Overpass) is used only as a discovery
// list of candidates — names + websites, queried live, never stored. Each
// selected candidate's own website then goes through the same
// admin-fill-from-website edge function as the editor's "Fill from website",
// and only the basics are saved (name, pin, country, address, website, phone,
// altitude, aircraft, description). Prices and opening hours are left for the
// community / admin, since they change and drafts get them wrong more often.
import AdminShell from '../../layouts/AdminShell.astro';
---
